2026-07-27T11:52:23.4664883Z i /tmp/RtmpAkNzdt/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:52:23.4665257Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:52:23.4666017Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:52:23.4666535Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:52:23.4667124Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:52:23.4667991Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:52:23.4668800Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
